places/cities.json is derived from the GeoNames geographical database
(https://www.geonames.org), file cities15000 as of 2026-10-10, which is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made: the places of 25,000 residents or more and the capitals of a
country or of a first-level region were kept; of each, its name, its place to
a thousandth of a degree, its residents to the thousand, and for a city of
the United States its state. Names in English were added from Natural Earth
5.1.1 populated places (public domain), each only where GeoNames lists the
same name for the same city. See scripts/geo/prepare-cities.mjs.

Credit, as the app gives it on a map that places a point by a city:
"Cities are placed by their name: GeoNames, CC BY 4.0."
